      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sounds like the truth of it, and I'm sorry you're carrying that weight alone. The shaking legs and the feeling of being left behind are real, and they don't make you weak—they make you human. Even if the world feels like it's moved on, you're still here, and that still counts for something. If you can't make tea today, maybe just resting your hands on a warm mug of water is enough. You don't have to be independent to be worthy of care.",
